{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body>\n\n<p>發佈時間：20:00 2026-10-24 HKT</p>\n<img alt=\"51歲杜如風近照驚變「紙片人」惹健康憂慮  曝光「有大單嘢」掀熱議\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/367f37e89c83930cca496a530adb7fbf/2026-10/KF_-_2026-10-24T224602_710.png\"/>\n<p>51歲的「日本旅遊達人」杜如風（Helen）早前曾因濕疹問題困擾，一度要長期服用類固醇，導致體重急增，杜如風當年為肥腫難分的身形，曾自嘲「肥過部貨車」。近年杜如風下定決心，積極減肥成功甩肉，而且冇再反彈，變得得越來越瘦。但昨日（23日）在社交平台公開的自拍照，激瘦身形惹健康憂慮。</p>\n<h2>杜如風手臂細如火柴</h2>\n<p>杜如風最新曝光的對鏡自拍近照，一身潮人打扮，身穿鮮黃色T恤配牛仔褲，戴上灰色冷帽及粗紅框眼鏡。但杜如風的身形暴瘦見骨，而且四肢纖幼，手臂幼如火柴，與昔日圓潤的身軀對比，身形薄如「紙片人」。</p>\n<img alt=\"杜如風體質易肥難瘦。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/6162cafb79e9d1ac32115f56fd651c34/2023-01/2018_2_1.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"杜如風於2022年時臉顆圓。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/a7c02263dd0c2e64792a961f53a00585/2023-01/2022_1.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"杜如風曾自嘲「肥過部貨車」。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/29891115d6fd96af66279cfb47f883c1/2023-01/japan_10.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"她嫌上鏡不好看，所以積極減肥。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/2d0ffe7a6025edd87a4cf788d24f808f/2023-01/ig_3_0.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"杜如風減肥後雙腿成「筷子腳」。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/e0d760451e161eccc5ad35e2eb5fc104/2026-10/TO_1_.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"杜如風9月時的照片，其臉容帶點憔悴。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/dc42434de00ff4a1a213cec630e960a2/2026-10/TO_3_.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"杜如風昨日（23日）在IG限時動態的自拍，暴瘦又憔悴令人擔憂。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/76823161bf48db44355818319d060ef9/2026-10/5_9_6.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"杜如風在2023年初，到日本拍攝節目《解風東京》。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/e5af50919dd12939a10a2340a5638cba/2023-01/japan.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"杜如風出發前嘗試生酮飲食減肥。成功，在4月個月內滅甩27磅！\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/25059a703c2dbbc9bd99fc16039d3c3b/2023-01/japan_11.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"杜如風靠生酮飲食減肥成功。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/9fff0babd10d46afc43d2efacca82561/2023-01/japan_1.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"杜如風在四月個月內滅甩27磅。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/6253e35b8ada0864187465fd49246128/2023-01/japan_9.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"杜如風穿上價值12,000港元的Sacai短身羽絨，身形未見臃腫。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/96ce69da50edc0a8a36c0b2c875d8726/2023-01/japan_6.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"杜如風減磅後自信回來。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/1d179584ca917a7a2b1e4c1e2da46567/2023-01/japan_2.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"杜如風甩肉後上鏡變得好看。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/dd91b7e57f3f94b305ed66e873d67fd2/2023-01/japan_3.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"杜如風分享跟馮德倫合照，竟然暴瘦至V煞臉及筷子腿。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/f67123b61d0e8600a44082d818dea80d/2026-03/3857823852680947783_22666316.jpeg\"/>\n<img alt=\"杜如風比起昔日瘦幾個碼。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/fc94cd160efe501a4d133d4a458df750/2026-03/3857823889574022775_22666316.jpeg\"/>\n<img alt=\"其實杜如風年輕時身材好fit。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/b9f41379d23eb2082208219cda4ae028/2023-01/young_2_0.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"年輕時的杜如風，身材好fit。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/1d1dc3a88b546ca694014676165a11cc/2023-01/young_1_0.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"杜如風早年好fit。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/be84849a249a7e53258c153f8102d0cf/2023-01/young_4.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"杜如風曾受濕疹困擾，要長期服用類固醇。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/c75003b798b79fbed39e79bfec3fba94/2023-01/young_3.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"杜如風父親是已故電影人杜惠東。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/da60d6bfecb998b60052318afe384fcc/2023-01/father_1.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"已故電影人杜惠東是杜如風的父親。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/4f522fce765e13650042a1d69f47a2e8/2023-01/father_2.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"杜如風與爸爸杜惠東感情非常好。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/c9f0112ee1cd1f8cddf9d7868be9ad21/2023-01/father_3.jpg\"/>\n<h2>杜如風暗示有新搞作</h2>\n<p>雖然杜如風戴上粗框大眼鏡遮擋，仍能見到其臉容略帶憔悴，體重亦明顯比之前再急降。杜如風在帖文中寫道：「呢扮靚！遲吓有大單嘢做，敬請留意！」似乎暗示接下來即將有新工作挑戰。</p>\n<h2>杜如風一個月再「縮水」</h2>\n<p>杜如風於今年9月曾分享到髮型屋做駁髮的素顏相，當時見到其身形纖瘦，但短短一個月時間再度「縮水」，不論身形與輪廓都現凹陷，與過往可謂判若兩人。不少網民對杜如風現時的狀態感到憂心：「會唔會瘦得滯？」更有人關心杜如風是否因減肥過度，而患上厭食症。</p>\n<img alt=\"杜如風因經常炫富而被封為世界級港女。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/dfa6e3959edc87965d394298957dc6b7/2024-07/UD_toyufung_3375430030854172163_22666316_2024_7_20.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"杜如風主持的旅遊節目大受歡迎，圓潤也成為她的標誌。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/7e30f79b603df419efb0b7f9689c901b/2023-06/toyufung_350498741_181541264550291_1101822918426255358_n.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"杜如風因主持J2的旅遊節目，介紹一系列的日本攻略，而被封為「日本旅遊達人」。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/bf67d45b4c405583cf6a60483268049f/2024-08/441517135_18441399163010317_1769458880066454117_n.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"2007年為TVB生活台主持《流行東京》人氣急升。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/1a37e902afb5dd04283c725cc6982627/2023-01/hqdefault_1.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"2007年為TVB生活台主持《流行東京》人氣急升。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/1c0caccc960ade68942be520400b2b25/2023-01/hqdefault%20%281%29_0.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"參與過好多旅遊節目。​\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/8c08c055e34ed71409ca4171c7a59bd6/2023-03/33_0_0.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"在旅遊節目中經常以古怪形象亮相。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/3298d03ea14ca939521a8442cfbe6473/2023-06/VideoScreenshot--HelenToToYuFungtoyufungInstagram-0_05_.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"竟有人視杜如風為人生目標。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/33594923c080ad036616d8217cb70eb1/2025-09/VS--6CPOmakaseFineDining-2-myTVSUPER-9_42_.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"杜如風主持的節目好受歡迎。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/afa3a1d1fcf8ed8db72da19cba4b1a59/2025-09/VS--6CPOmakaseFineDining-2-myTVSUPER-16_16_.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"杜如風舊地重遊，去了中古名牌手袋旗艦店。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/8b915fec8f55bab35409e4c9857b76e1/2025-09/VS--2Caf-2-myTVSUPER-1_33_.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"睇中一個迷你背囊，同樣叫價80萬yen，相當於4萬幾蚊港紙。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/63f44caf89747a5f4a477628b77835e4/2025-09/VS--2Caf-2-myTVSUPER-5_57_.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"有人留言稱杜如風根本不是「世界級港女」而是正宗香港公主。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/d687a09f2bd705b9c1358e60ff6469e7/2025-09/VS--2Caf-2-myTVSUPER-6_39_.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"杜如風推介一間二手名牌店。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/71d0cd7de1381dd0efbd77c4f41896a2/2025-09/VS--5--myTVSUPER-7_35_.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"杜如風最愛shopping。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/8eef408ee97db521b23fa5eaf9d0a3e1/2025-09/VS--5--myTVSUPER-9_06_.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"一見靚袋即刻不冷靜。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/7dba18112fc5541e29c83c79942d7c78/2025-09/VS--5--myTVSUPER-2_04_.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"如風在上一輯《解風東京》去了中古名牌手袋旗艦店，「介紹一個叫價57萬yen嘅CHANEL的筒型手袋，相當於33000蚊港紙。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/a3175d5d6dbfb292867a8d97fc2537f4/2025-09/VS--5--myTVSUPER-2_16_.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"杜如風直言：「我買埋啲袋其實係希望有一日破產嘅時候拎晒啲袋去賣。」\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/c4a26cdd930292495348a3ffe862db33/2025-09/VS--5--myTVSUPER-2_20_.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"杜如風識飲識食。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/c7b8aa29e30231a97ff6e844d198d6b4/2025-09/VS--14-2-myTVSUPER-9_22_.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"杜如風識飲識食。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/b9fdcdc4cdd08307d404c1d0a190be0e/2025-09/VS--14-2-myTVSUPER-19_24_.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"杜如風識飲識食。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/5f37f0410b8c91304bfc9c0ec9734f4a/2025-09/VS--2Caf-2-myTVSUPER-2_45_.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"杜如風推介一間二手名牌店。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/5d0ab96c6e64f0a8a0736c63bd523d9d/2023-12/24_13.png\"/>\n<img alt=\"當中一款Hermès袋賣過百萬港元。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/66d39aabeb3a6756dcc581c7bdabc673/2023-12/26_15.png\"/>\n<img alt=\"杜如風經不起製作組「誘惑」，終於在鏡頭前破費。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/fdba8c67ae4ea9ebc666dce5491f3a4c/2023-12/28_13.png\"/>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-24T14:53:44.431671+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":499,"images":47,"source":"星島頭條","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-24T12:00:31+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-24T17:18:20.637857+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-24T14:50:55.611390+00:00","content_hash":"f91bfbe215fa39a94f3f16057317a7a3c8d8e753af3c00ec376f8c6e3301d23c","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}